text = "The heavy hydraulic blast doors groan open, revealing the dark descent into the abandoned research subterranean core.

Your handheld radio crackles through the static with Dr. Aris Vance's voice:
[color=#00e5ff]\"Ellis... if you're hearing this, you bypassed the quarantine barrier. But be warned: the acoustic dampeners failed hours ago. The thing in Sub-Level 4... it reacts to sound.\"[/color]

[color=#50fa7b][b]MILESTONE 1 COMPLETE![/b][/color] You successfully explored the room, solved the environmental clues, and bypassed the security door."

